{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The codec and hash findings check out. The traversal finding also exposes a real source dependency: several helpers use unsorted map iteration while minting IDs. I’ll specify shared ordering changes as a prerequisite for both CLJC and Rust; sorting only in Rust would break parity. The revision will explicitly distinguish those planned changes from current kernel behavior.\n"}}
